es does not work, in all my attempts the following error appears (matching\r\n assymetry), someone could guide me ... </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">&quot;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Error in matrix(PSh$ANOVA$df[nrow(RSS) + 1], nrow(RSS), ncol(RSS)) : </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>  non-numeric matrix extent</b><span><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">&quot;</span></b></span><br>\r\n <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">Thanks for your time,</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">Ana</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">  <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(12,52,61)\">Ana Celia Montes de Oca-Aguilar</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Arial Narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(12,52,61)\">Investigadora Nacional I (</span><span style